Third-party assets bundled in this repository keep their own licences:

- public/models/CarConcept.glb — CarConcept from KhronosGroup/glTF-Sample-Assets,
  by Eric Chadwick from a public-domain model. Licensed CC BY 4.0, attribution to
  Darmstadt Graphics Group GmbH.
- Chakra Petch and JetBrains Mono — SIL Open Font License 1.1. Fetched by
  next/font at build time and self-hosted into the static export.

Model weights (Depth Anything V2 Small, CLIP) are not bundled. They stream at
runtime from the Hugging Face CDN under their own licences and are cached by the
visitor's browser.
